; ONE VARIABLE: the FORM of a surface's material reference — a `SubResource` of
; the mesh's OWN `.tres` instead of an `ExtResource` to a shared material file.
;
; Both quads carry the SAME albedo/metallic/roughness. The left surface's
; material is an ExtResource (res://unit-arraymesh-own-material-shared.tres);
; the right surface's is a `[sub_resource]` declared inside
; unit-arraymesh-own-material-quad.tres itself. The pair must therefore read as
; two identical blue plates — the left one is the control, so a regression in the
; sub-resource form shows as the RIGHT plate turning white while the left keeps
; its colour, which localises the break to the reference form and nothing else.
;
; Why a regression here is invisible in every other scene: no other fixture, and
; no other golden, contains a `.tres` that declares a material as its own
; sub-resource. `arraymesh` carries no material at all, `arraymesh-uv` and
; `arraymesh-compressed` both reference a shared material file by ExtResource,
; `grid-map` loads a materialless quad, and every scene-level material in the bag
; is a `[sub_resource]` of the previewed `.tscn` — a different document, resolved
; by a different mechanism (SceneResourcesContext). So the whole
; "sub-resource of another .tres" path has no witness but this one.
[gd_scene load_steps=2 format=3 uid="uid://unitarraymeshownmat"]

[ext_resource type="ArrayMesh" path="res://unit-arraymesh-own-material-quad.tres" id="1_quad"]

[node name="Root" type="Node3D"]

[node name="Quads" type="MeshInstance3D" parent="."]
transform = Transform3D(1, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0)
mesh = ExtResource("1_quad")

[node name="Title" type="Label3D" parent="."]
transform = Transform3D(1, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 1.8, 0)
text = "ArrayMesh surface material: ExtResource vs own SubResource"
pixel_size = 0.006
billboard = 1
modulate = Color(1, 1, 0.7, 1)

[node name="Description" type="Label3D" parent="."]
transform = Transform3D(1, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, -1.8, 0)
text = "Both plates must be the same blue; a white RIGHT plate is the regression"
pixel_size = 0.005
billboard = 1
modulate = Color(1, 1, 1, 1)
